[msg MSG_001 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}I see that you have braved
the Labyrinth of Amala and
returned a candelabrum.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}I am confident that you will recover
the remaining candelabra too.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}You must be cautious, though.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}The Fiends that stole the candelabra
are unique and powerful demons.
{wait}

[msg MSG_002 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}...Now that I think about it,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}this all started because of one man
who caused the Conception in
the previous world.
{wait}

[msg MSG_003 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}The Conception... Because of it,
the Vortex World was born.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}Kagutsuchi... the source of light
and power for this world...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}You who once lived as a human
must be wandering this world
without any understanding.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}To show you my appreciation for
returning the candelabrum,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}I would like to share with you
my knowledge on the Vortex World
and Kagutsuchi.
{wait}

[msg MSG_004 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Kagutsuchi... It is the light
whose sole purpose is to empower
the one who will oversee creation.
{wait}

[msg MSG_004B speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Creation is the act of bringing
a new world into existence,
made possible by the annihilation
of the old world.
{wait}

[msg MSG_005 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}Kagutsuchi will allow a life form
of its choosing to determine
the course of the new world.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}There must be those in Tokyo who
yearn to be chosen by Kagutsuchi,
in order to realize their vision.
{wait}

[msg MSG_005B speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}The shape of the world to come
