place where creation occurs.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}Kagutsuchi rises, matures,
and falls in countless other places.
{wait}

[msg MSG_007 speaker 0] // Lady in black
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}There are millions--no, billions
